# Jr goat refinements governance

## When

After executionist Turn B and auto-tests (B′), **before** Turn C.

Skill: **`vs-jr-goat`** or **`vs-jr-goat-NN-<short>`**.

## Verdict

Executionist **always** states recommend / optional / skip and whether `/vs-jr-goat-NN-<short>` is the next step. The agent may push a **recommend**; the human decides.

## Sub-chunks

Accepted issues append to the parent chunk (`## Jr goat sub-chunks` + `plan/chunks/<id>-jr-<n>.md`). They circle back into the same program. Max **three** per pass. Not a new program. Not filler.

## Voice

**`vibe-scaler/VOICE.md`**.
